      "name": "Tamar",
      "username": "Tamar",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-19T14:17:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, and for the love of a non-specific deific type power, have “girly”/fitted options! I know I’ve talked about this in person with some of you, but I HATE when there’s a really cool shirt design but it’s only available in the non-fitted style.  I will pay an extra couple of dollars, if necessary, to get a shirt that fits me the way I want it to.</p>\n<p>If we want to talk design specifics, I’m especially partial to non centered in the middle of the chest designs (Like <a href=\"http://www.threadless.com/product/2280/Zombie_at_Tiffany_s/tab,girls/style,shirt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.threadless.com/product/2280/Zombie_at_Tiffany_s/tab,girls/style,shirt</a> or <a href=\"http://www.threadless.com/product/2410/Le_Voyage/tab,girls/style,shirt\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://www.threadless.com/product/2410/Le_Voyage/tab,girls/style,shirt</a>).  I also second WriterRyan’s desire for not just black shirts.</p>",
