      "id": 21585,
      "name": "WriterRyan",
      "username": "WriterRyan",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/writerryan/{size}/2710_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-08-19T14:26:32.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, it seems like people who design shirts for nerds think that nerds never actually go outside and prefer to only wear black.</p>\n<p>I’ve never been a huge fan of the off-centered designs though. They look good on some people, but if you wear it with a coat/jacket, then you can’t even see the design. And they kinda draw attention to the one part of my body where I store my fat…</p>",
